Why this fixes your previous Jenkins failure

Your previous Jenkins build failed because production mode requires ENCRYPTION_KEY, but the backend test container was started without it. The corrected Stage 10 obtains the Jenkins secret through:

withCredentials([
    string(
        credentialsId: 'cag-website-v2-ci-encryption-key',
        variable: 'ENCRYPTION_KEY'
    )
])

and passes it into Docker:

-e ENCRYPTION_KEY="${ENCRYPTION_KEY}"

The actual secret value never goes into GitHub or the Jenkinsfile.

